                            <div class="sn-tx">@(emHolder?.Name ?? "A consul") of @(w.House(em.HouseId)?.Name) holds them, since year @em.Since.@(emMine && em.Due ? $" Each year you keep them costs the Reach's trust, your house's standing and every head's regard; after {EmergencySystem.KeptMax} the Senate takes them." : "")</div>
